<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's MUI 1996 net down 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's MUI 1996 net down 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	  5.0    vs	  6.1</p>
<p>    Net profit		   65.44   vs	 78.52</p>
<p>    Revenue		   1,438.77   vs	907.47</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    192.52   vs	174.99</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less    85.66   vs less  41.08</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  less     1.24   vs add   39.31</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	    5.0    vs	  7.5</p>
<p>Note - Malayan United Industries Bhd is a diversified group with interests in media, cement, property and construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
